but you cannot find the light switch."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_AMB_waves_and_seagulls_oneshot","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Splash... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The waves strike the hull of the boat rhythmically. The salty sea air is laced with a barely noticeable tinge of floral fragrance."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not again?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Applause","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Clap, clap, clap... A bout of crisp applause comes from behind you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You have worked hard to give these children a perfect ending."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You mean Franchouchou...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You have changed the course of destiny. Now it will continue in the direction you have chosen."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stop talking to me in riddles! I just want to know what's going to happen!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Your destiny is in your own hands."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You—"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The boat suddenly surges forward at high speed. You can hear the sound of its bow cutting through the surface of the sea..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Livingroom_c","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"openEyes","raw":"睁眼"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"3","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"3","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You slowly open your eyes and find yourself sitting in the living room of the mansion. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The sun is shining brightly outside, and even the dilapidated mansion seems clear and radiant in the sunlight. You appear to be alone in the silent building."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The calendar shows that this is the following day of the concert. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"According to Franchouchou's usual schedule, they should be out either training or working their shifts."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What about me...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You stare at the flowers on the table in a daze. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is already the eighth day. You have fulfilled your end of the bargain. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You can step out of this mansion with a clear conscience and start finding your way back to Griffin."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You have been looking forward to this day, but now that it is here, you feel a little sad. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You have to admit that you've grown very fond of Franchouchou, and you are going to miss them."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_TurnOverCard","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just then, you notice a note pressed under the vase. You pull it out and slowly unfold it."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Saga_AVG_Day","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, we won't disturb you since you're still asleep. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"By the time you wake up, we'll probably be out training or working. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Yugiri said she'd cook a nice dinner tonight, so look forward to it~ "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"By the way, we have already asked someone we know to investigate this Griffin base that you mentioned. Miss Kalina also said she'd help. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We believe that you will be able to find your way home in no time. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But until then, please stay with us and show us the way!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even if you haven't said anything, they have already figured out what is on your mind."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone is working so hard, I can't afford to be lazy either."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After a comfortable stretch, you pick up a thick stack of Franchouchou promotional flyers and head outside."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreenOn","raw":"白屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"whitescreenOff","raw":"白屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"2023SAGA_Villa_D","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Door_Open_Close","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Click. The warm sunlight envelops you. You squint as you take in the grass glimmering in the sun. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This world is such a beautiful place, but it will be even better if Franchouchou's songs can be heard far and wide. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is your next mission."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, I'd better do my best before I return to the Griffin base."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You leave the mansion to embrace a brand new day."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
